                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Mod(X_2)
          %p
            (
            %a{:href => "#BondalvdBerg03"}> Bondal-vdBerg 03
            ,
            = succeed ")" do
              %a{:href => "#BFN08"} BFN 08, proof of prop. 3.24
          %h3#CocontinuityAndAdjoints In indexed monoidal categories
          %p
            Suppose an
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/indexed+monoidal+category"} indexed monoidal category
            which satisfies the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/motivic+yoga"} motivic yoga
            (
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Wirthm%C3%BCller+context"}> Wirthmüller context
            \-form) in that:
          %ol
            %li
              %p
                the corresponding
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pseudofunctor"} pseudofunctor
                takes values in
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/adjoint+functors"} adjoint functors
              .maruku-equation
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mrow
                        %mtable
                          %mtr
                            %mtd
                              %mpadded{:lspace => "-100%width", :width => "0"}
