              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/preserves+colimits"} preserves colimits
              in each variable.
          .proof
            %h6 Proof
            %p
            %p
              Consider any
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/object"} object
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
